# macOS
.DS_Store

# SAFETY NOTE
# -----------
# This repo (website/) contains ONLY generated public output. All sensitive
# material -- grades, exams, and pset solutions -- lives in the PARENT folder
# (../grades, ../midterm, ../final, ../pset/*/*_solutions.pdf), outside this
# repo, so it is never tracked by git here.
#
# build.py wipes and repopulates slides/, psets/, and syllabus/ on every run,
# copying only the specific public files it is told to. A pset's solutions are
# copied in ONLY when its name is listed in RELEASE_SOLUTIONS in build.py.
#
# The patterns below are a backstop against anyone ever dropping a sensitive
# folder directly inside website/ by mistake. (Note: pset solution PDFs are
# intentionally NOT ignored, because the release toggle must be able to ship
# them when you choose to.)
grades/
midterm/
final/
*answer_key*
